(7640063, 1240263, 67258, '<td valign="top">Excellent work on the mono conversion, and a strong composition.  It may be worth revisiting your sharpening as there is some slight haloing around the shoulder and back of the boy.  The image is really good, and warrants that just tweaking.</td>', 'Excellent work on the mono conversion, and a strong composition.  It may be worth revisiting your sharpening as there is some slight haloing around the shoulder and back of the boy.  The image is really good, and warrants that just tweaking.', '2019-09-01 06:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7640064, 1239479, 67258, '<td valign="top">Ha, how wonderful!  The overlay works really well here - takes the image into another world, as though we are peeking through one of those old beach telescopes, with years of grime covering the lens. Bumping to a 7.</td>', 'Ha, how wonderful!  The overlay works really well here - takes the image into another world, as though we are peeking through one of those old beach telescopes, with years of grime covering the lens. Bumping to a 7.', '2019-09-01 06:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
