(7640317, 1240450, 77196, '<td valign="top">For me, the bird and the fish are just out of the focused area, and it looks like the feather detail was lost in pp. Background is a bit messy. Great timing - I know that the fish is only in that position for a few brief seconds before being swallowed...</td>', 'For me, the bird and the fish are just out of the focused area, and it looks like the feather detail was lost in pp. Background is a bit messy. Great timing - I know that the fish is only in that position for a few brief seconds before being swallowed...', '2019-09-03 16:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
