(7640908, 1240376, 16148, '<td valign="top">Best that I''ve seen on DPC in a while.  Welcome back!  Makes me want to grab my camera and go for a ride or take a walk.</td>', 'Best that I''ve seen on DPC in a while.  Welcome back!  Makes me want to grab my camera and go for a ride or take a walk.', '2019-09-08 09:45:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(7640917, 1239479, 100831, '<td valign="top">Continuing on.... the filtered sky gives the whole image kind of a fishbowl effect.  Probably thats what drew me in in the first place but I didnt realize it. Its such an interesting image. Worthy of much more than a fleeting glance.</td>', 'Continuing on.... the filtered sky gives the whole image kind of a fishbowl effect.  Probably thats what drew me in in the first place but I didnt realize it. Its such an interesting image. Worthy of much more than a fleeting glance.', '2019-09-08 10:54:01.000000', NULL, 0),
