(7640920, 1239736, 83313, '<td valign="top">Did wayyy better than mine. I think I may have made mine too dark because of the challenge topic I entered it into. Looks like you may have also taken yours from a few feet further to the right. Being a 3 frame shot with a FF camera, as opposed my M4/3 single frame probably didn''t hurt either. It''s a good learning experience to see how others handle the same exact scene.</td>', 'Did wayyy better than mine. I think I may have made mine too dark because of the challenge topic I entered it into. Looks like you may have also taken yours from a few feet further to the right. Being a 3 frame shot with a FF camera, as opposed my M4/3 single frame probably didn''t hurt either. It''s a good learning experience to see how others handle the same exact scene.', '2019-09-08 11:48:31.000000', NULL, 0),
